{"title": "Show HN: 100fasttools – small, fast browser tools", "link": "https://100fasttools.com/", "summary": "<p>I built 100fasttools as a simple static site for tiny tools that should open fast and get out of the way.<p>Current tools include a Reddit banner generator, a search engine query builder, and an X advanced search builder. No signup, no dashboard, no tracking-heavy app idea. Just small tools.<p>Feedback is welcome, especially on what tool should come next.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48441559\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48441559</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>", "published": "2026-06-08T05:17:12+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "Show HN: 100fasttools – small, fast browser tools", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://100fasttools.com/", "published_at": "2026-06-08T05:17:12+00:00", "summary": "<p>I built 100fasttools as a simple static site for tiny tools that should open fast and get out of the way.<p>Current tools include a Reddit banner generator, a search engine query builder, and an X advanced search builder. No signup, no dashboard, no tracking-heavy app idea. Just small tools.<p>Feedback is welcome, especially on what tool should come next.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48441559\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48441559</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>"}}, "logged_at": "2026-06-08T05:51:44.014901+00:00"}
